??? 250
BDAT 85 LAST
>>> To: Susan@random.com\r\nFrom: Sam@random.com\r\n\r\nbody-start-AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA
stoptls
>>> X
??? 421 Lost incoming connection
****
millisleep 500
#
# 2: the same shutdown, with nothing offered in clear afterwards.
#
# Same chunk arithmetic, same point in the body, so the server reaches the same
# place by the same route.  What differs is that nothing follows the shutdown, so
# the server has nothing unconsumed to reset over and the close is clean.  That
# is what lets the end of file be asserted here, and asserting it is the point of
# this session: a server which answered 421 and then left the socket usable would
# satisfy session 1 on its own.
#
